.TH DOLPHIN-CLEAN-TITLE 1 "September 2026" "Dolphin Clean Title 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dolphin-clean-title \- remove the Dolphin suffix from X11 window titles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dolphin-clean-title
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.br
.B dolphin-clean-title
.RB [ \-\-background | \-\-stop | \-\-check | \-\-diagnose ]
.RB [ \-\-verbose ] [ \-\-log-file PATH ]
.br
.B dolphin-clean-title
.RB { enable | disable | status | ui }
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dolphin-clean-title
rewrites a matching trailing \(em Dolphin or - Dolphin suffix from Dolphin
window titles before X11 window lists and taskbars display them.
.PP
The feature uses a user-local Dolphin launcher and an X11/XWayland title
cleaner. It does not modify Dolphin or third-party desktop components.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B enable
Enable title cleaning and persist the choice.
.TP
.B disable
Disable title cleaning and remove user-local activation files.
.TP
.B status
Report whether the feature is enabled.
.TP
.B ui
Open the settings application.
.SH SERVICE OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-background
Start the cleaner as a detached background service and return.
.TP
.B \-\-check
Validate the current X11/XWayland environment and exit without changing
activation.
.TP
.B \-\-stop
Stop the running cleaner.
.TP
.B \-\-diagnose
Print environment and runtime diagnostics.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the installed version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Also write debug-level service messages to standard error.
.TP
.B \-\-log-file PATH
Write service logs to PATH instead of the default XDG state-directory log.
.PP
The internal \-\-foreground mode is used by the detached service and is not
normally invoked directly.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/bin/dolphin-clean-title
The command installed by the Debian package.
.TP
.I ~/.local/bin/dolphin-clean-title
The command installed by the source-checkout development installer, when used.
.TP
.I ~/.local/bin/dolphin
The user-local Dolphin launcher created when title cleaning is enabled.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/autostart/com.github.d0d1.DolphinCleanTitle.desktop
The user-session activation entry created when title cleaning is enabled.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/applications/com.github.d0d1.DolphinCleanTitle.desktop
The user-local settings-app launcher managed by the source installer.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/dolphin-clean-title/
Persistent state, service PID, and default logs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dolphin (1)
